      "body": "All 6 empty code cells are completed and the notebook runs cleanly with no errors.\n\nFilled in:\n\n- **Cell 1** \u2014 `library('tidymodels')`\n- **Cell 8** \u2014 `juice(rec) |> head()` to inspect the prepped recipe\n- **Cell 12** \u2014 fit the decision tree: `mod_fit = mod |> fit(children ~ ., data = juice(rec))`\n- **Cell 14** \u2014 `rpart.plot::rpart.plot(mod_fit$fit)`\n- **Cell 16** \u2014 random forest with `set_engine('ranger', importance = 'impurity')` and `set_mode('classification')`, fit on `juice(rec)`\n- **Cell 18** \u2014 `rf_fit |> extract_fit_engine() |> vip::vip(num_features = 20)`\n\nBoth plots render (tree diagram + importance chart), and the RF fit reports 500 trees over 27 variables with OOB Brier score \u2248 0.042. No new package installs were needed (`rpart.plot`, `ranger`, `vip` were already available).",
